{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOST VECTOR EX is stylish high-speed parkour racing at it's finest. With speeds unapologetically fast.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/b01e013d8ac6c42e67b46e6779cf4655.poster.avif?t=1772015381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/b01e013d8ac6c42e67b46e6779cf4655.webm?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/b01e013d8ac6c42e67b46e6779cf4655.mp4?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/2984ca3f4c9a26ddf187fd8192649988.webp?t=1772015381\" width=1560 height=56 /></span>Race unique fully handcrafted maps. Each special and take place in a massive variety of locales. Race vertical beaches, down the sides of megalithic skyscrapers, or unreal dreamscapes that are totally not existential in nature! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/012d3359d1b9e142bd84a3b268df523d.webp?t=1772015381\" width=1560 height=56 /></span>Easy to learn. Full of depth. Fully dynamic.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the VECTOR MASTERS, each one unique and vastly different from one another. Utilizing their own BOOST and STYLE that gives them an edge on the circuit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into a charge jump into a side-strafe into a wall-ride, do a couple special tricks, and then boost your way on out. There are many ways to tackle a circuit in unique ways. Let nothing stop your momentum. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/44466d489d1cc0651007537a4d23a3d0.poster.avif?t=1772015381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/44466d489d1cc0651007537a4d23a3d0.webm?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/44466d489d1cc0651007537a4d23a3d0.mp4?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/2e07e988f619f71cc1d1bcf08c559129.webp?t=1772015381\" width=1560 height=56 /></span>Just Boost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's in your blood. And... It's in the name. (duh) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a dedicated section in the description just for this. That's how important it is! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/3a1b8087b44e76ad4f6581ca8a0f2764.webp?t=1772015381\" width=1560 height=56 /></span>Talk with the Masters and grow your bonds! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full-on graphic novel styled story based in a alternate, newly reclaimed world!\u00a0Learn about the various aspects of the great Vector World Cup. Get to know the Masters that hone their craft. From legendary tuners, to indie-cup legends born into this sport. The art of Vector racing is a unforgiving one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/8abfc608f5e4978f4d02afe67e68c247.poster.avif?t=1772015381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/8abfc608f5e4978f4d02afe67e68c247.webm?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/8abfc608f5e4978f4d02afe67e68c247.mp4?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/649d9fde0e129f8d8364e0a5cd32d213.webp?t=1772015381\" width=1560 height=56 /></span>Play with friends. Or your rivals... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on lobbies of the best racers imaginable. And friends! Dare I say that they'll probably do some dastardly shortcuts no one dare attempt otherwise. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/872643897f5199b193a6a7017da3d5a8.poster.avif?t=1772015381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/872643897f5199b193a6a7017da3d5a8.webm?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/872643897f5199b193a6a7017da3d5a8.mp4?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/e7fcbecea503e0110a8c267a57784d61.avif?t=1772015381\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run fast. Faster than any other.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832030?t=1772015381","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3832030?t=1772015381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/3ed69a1b63670a13fbed3e6bcf952ffea344856c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772015381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/3ed69a1b63670a13fbed3e6bcf952ffea344856c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772015381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4338440,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOOST VECTOR EX is stylish high-speed parkour racing at it's finest. With speeds unapologetically fast.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/b01e013d8ac6c42e67b46e6779cf4655.poster.avif?t=1772015381\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832030/extras/b01e013d8ac6c42e67b46e6779cf4655.webm?t=1772015381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama